# ⿽十邱

**⿽十邱** is a binary operator that evaluates the sum of lengths of English names of each number.

For example, 1 ⿽十邱 1 = 6 since "one" is three letters long.

The operator ⿽十邱 is notably used in ["Black Magic"](https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hk/%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E9%AD%94%E8%A1%93)[^1] games as a means to sow confusion.

[^1]: A genre of games with "hidden rules". 